From 5a8861cbc6c722b10a798c71e9745fffd0c8b417 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elkir0 <elkir0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/24] ARM: dts: samsung: add Samsung Galaxy Tab S2 8.0 LTE
 (SM-T715)

Board file validated on the device: bootloader interface (one-cell root,
DTBH keys, memory and reservations), SMP, watchdog, S2MPS13 PMIC, eMMC,
USB device with the SM5703 MUIC, thermal trips, PS_HOLD power-off, native
display, touchscreen, keys and Mali-T760 GPU; plus the still-untested
Wi-Fi/Bluetooth, audio and sensor fragments, and gts28ltexx_defconfig.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
