+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+/*
+ * Samsung Galaxy Tab S2 8.0 LTE (SM-T715), Exynos5433 - milestone 7
+ *
+ * Board file (validated base: PMIC, eMMC, USB, SMP, watchdog) plus the
+ * motion sensors and cover Hall switch (LSM6DS3 IMU, YAS537 magnetometer
+ * on hsi2c_10, gpio-keys SW_LID) from exynos5433-gts28ltexx-m7.dtsi.
+ * See docs/SENSORS_M7.md.
+ */
+
