+/*
+ * All PMIC values are transcribed from the device's live device tree
+ * (01_dumps/live_fdt.dts) and mapped onto the mainline bindings; see
+ * docs/DT_M2.md for the value-by-value source table.
+ *
+ * HSI2C channel 0 carries the S2MPS13 PMIC.
+ * live_fdt.dts: hsi2c@14E40000 (compatible "samsung,exynos5-hsi2c",
